      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jordan's Ten Minutes</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A morning routine that survives a rushed life</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"175\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(14,165,233,0.15)\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0:00</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\">Stand Up, No Phone</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Clock across the room; phone charges in the kitchen</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\">The reflex is removed by arrangement, not willpower</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"340\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1:30</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">Three Specific Thanks</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"433\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">The quiet room, a kind text, a healthy body</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"465\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\">Specific beats vague — about ninety seconds</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"505\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3:30</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"555\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">Five Slow Breaths</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"598\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Inhale four counts, exhale six — about two minutes</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"630\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\">The nervous system settles into focus</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"670\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5:30</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\">One Intention</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"763\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\">\"Be fully present in conversations today\"</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"795\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\">Repeat once, then stand and begin</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"835\" width=\"940\" height=\"105\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.13)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Weeks later: less anxiety, slower stress reaction,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"918\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">and the day feels like it belongs to Jordan</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1010\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1055\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No app, no subscription — just order and a few minutes</text></svg>",
      "caption": "A worked ten-minute morning: stand, thank, breathe, intend."
